  "_comment": "Signal -> susceptibility feature catalogue. GENERIC, not target-specific: each family lists which recon signals (fact category + optional keywords in the fact value) make a pretext plausible for ANY target. No pretext is favoured a priori; favour emerges from the target's own facts (a-priori) and then from observed reactions (empirical). Weights sum per family; probability = 1 - exp(-1.1 * sum). Keywords are lowercase substrings matched in the fact value. Shared by strategy.py and the frontend via /api/signals.",
